{"ocrText": "V.  I.  LENIN\n102\nThe Socialist-Revolutionaries and the Mensheviks, who\nconstitute ruling parties, have been defeated over the Ukrai-\nnian issue by yielding to the counter-revolutionary Cadet\nCavaignacs.\nPravda  No.  84,\nPublished  according  to\nJune  30  (17),  1917\nthe  Pravda  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "V.  I.  LENIN", "x": 44.62, "y": 6.11, "w": 13.0, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "102", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.32, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "The Socialist-Revolutionaries and the Mensheviks, who", "x": 13.9, "y": 9.53, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "constitute ruling parties, have been defeated over the Ukrai-", "x": 11.11, "y": 11.47, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "nian issue by yielding to the counter-revolutionary Cadet", "x": 11.11, "y": 13.39, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Cavaignacs.", "x": 11.11, "y": 15.33, "w": 15.38, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 12.44, "y": 19.23, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 20.53, "y": 19.22, "w": 3.23, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "84", "x": 24.68, "y": 19.27, "w": 2.12, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 27.02, "y": 19.22, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 68.24, "y": 19.22, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 78.58, "y": 19.22, "w": 9.36, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "to", "x": 88.83, "y": 19.22, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "June", "x": 11.2, "y": 20.55, "w": 4.54, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "30", "x": 16.65, "y": 20.61, "w": 2.12, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 19.79, "y": 20.55, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "17", "x": 20.59, "y": 20.61, "w": 1.8, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 22.61, "y": 20.55, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 24.86, "y": 20.61, "w": 3.9